# Built binaries and per-machine state.
#
# Same separation the rest of this repo uses: the SOURCE is tracked, the things
# the program writes about THIS machine are not.
#
# roadmap-watcher-state.json holds the baseline of cards this machine has
# already seen and when it last completed a good run. Committing it would ship
# one machine's idea of "already known" to every other, so a card somebody else
# has never seen would arrive pre-marked as old - which is the one thing a
# tripwire must never do.
#
# roadmap-watcher-settings.json is written with defaults on first run, so a
# fresh checkout gets a correct one without carrying anybody's edits.
*.exe
roadmap-watcher-state.json
roadmap-watcher-settings.json
